  "limits": [
    "Three generic process corners only; mixed and device-specific statistical corners remain unqualified.",
    "SKY130 voltage extrema are documented; temperatures remain selected test points. The five geometry points are the union of N/P characterization sizes.",
    "GF180 geometry and characterization temperatures are published. Gate/drain sweep stops at nominal 3.3 V and body bias is selected, not a documented reliability envelope.",
    "IHP dimensions and maximum drain-source voltage are published. Gate stops at nominal 1.2 V; reverse body bias and 0/85 C are selected test points.",
    "This does not establish continuous-range coverage, silicon calibration, reliability/ESD ratings, RF or physical acceptance.",
    "IHP runs with the Linux/WSL OSDI engine. Native Windows IHP OSDI and final installed-release acceptance are not established."
  ]
